WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.860
The yellow cart lay on its side.

2
00:00:09.861 --> 00:00:13.694
Pots and pans spilled onto the road.

3
00:00:13.695 --> 00:00:20.209
Food was scattered on the grass.

4
00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:24.826
"What a complete mess!" said Mole.

5
00:00:24.827 --> 00:00:28.482
Rat jumped up and down.

6
00:00:28.483 --> 00:00:32.672
"Crazy drivers!" shouted Rat.

7
00:00:32.673 --> 00:00:37.163
"I’m going to call the police!"

8
00:00:37.164 --> 00:00:42.356
"Look! The horse has run away," said Mole.

9
00:00:42.357 --> 00:00:46.438
"The cart has a broken wheel," said Rat.

10
00:00:46.439 --> 00:00:51.139
"I’ll go find the horse," said Mole.

11
00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:56.928
"I’ll clean up this mess," said Rat.

12
00:00:56.929 --> 00:01:02.238
Toad sat in the road staring after the car.

13
00:01:02.239 --> 00:01:07.247
He had a big smile on his face.

14
00:01:07.248 --> 00:01:12.245
"Vroom! Vroom!" said Toad.

15
00:01:12.246 --> 00:01:15.632
"What?" said Rat.

16
00:01:15.633 --> 00:01:19.586
"Vroom! Vroom! Vroom!" said Toad.

17
00:01:19.587 --> 00:01:24.099
"Toad! What’s the matter with you?" said Rat.

18
00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:28.747
Toad just sat in the middle of the road.

19
00:01:28.748 --> 00:01:33.170
"Vroom! Vroom!" he said.

20
00:01:33.171 --> 00:01:37.519
Rat put the broken wheel next to the cart.

21
00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:40.713
He found the birdcage on the road.

22
00:01:40.714 --> 00:01:43.914
It was upside-down.

23
00:01:43.915 --> 00:01:47.645
"Poor birdie," Rat said.

24
00:01:47.646 --> 00:01:51.234
Mole returned with the horse.

25
00:01:51.235 --> 00:01:55.379
"What’s wrong with Toad?" Mole asked.

26
00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:58.797
"He’s in some kind of dream," said Rat.

27
00:01:58.798 --> 00:02:01.598
"I wish he would help clean up."

28
00:02:01.599 --> 00:02:05.739
Toad slowly lifted his arm.

29
00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:10.905
He pointed at the far-off cloud of dust.

30
00:02:10.906 --> 00:02:16.729
"Now that’s the real way to travel!" shouted Toad.

31
00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:20.558
"In a car!"

